---
import Editorial from '../layouts/Editorial.astro';
import { printers } from '../data/printers';
import { amazonLink } from '../lib/affiliate';
import { amazonAssociateTag } from '../config/integrations';
const active = printers.some((p) => amazonLink(p.asin, amazonAssociateTag));
---

<Editorial
  title="How Tagrivo is supported."
  description="A clear explanation of affiliate links, editorial independence, and what a purchase through a link can mean."
>
  <p>
    <strong>Last updated: October 29, 2026.</strong>
  </p>
  <p>
    Tagrivo is intended to be supported by affiliate commissions. When you follow an identified
    affiliate link and make a qualifying purchase, we may earn a commission. Tagrivo does not add a
    fee to your purchase.
  </p>
  {active ? (
    <p>
      <strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong>
    </p>
  ) : (
    <p>
      <strong>No Amazon affiliate purchase links are active in this edition.</strong> Product links
      currently direct you to manufacturer information. We do not imply membership in an affiliate
      program before it is configured.
    </p>
  )}
  <h2>How to recognize an affiliate link</h2>
  <p>
    When enabled, Amazon purchase links carry an adjacent commission disclosure. Those links are
    marked as sponsored in the page markup. A link to a manufacturer's specifications or support
    documentation is provided as evidence and is not an affiliate purchase link in this edition.
  </p>
  <h2>What commissions do not buy</h2>
  <p>
    Payment does not determine whether a model is compatible with your device, make it meet a
    budget, or remove a limitation from an analysis. The Finder's eligibility rules use product
    facts and your answers, not affiliate commissions.
  </p>
  <p>
    We do not offer paid placement in the initial shortlist. We do not invent reviews, testimonials,
    or hands-on testing. See our <a href="/methodology/">editorial methodology</a> for the
    boundaries of the current research.
  </p>
  <h2>Prices, availability, and other websites</h2>
  <p>
    Retailer prices and availability can change. A dated manufacturer price is identified as such.
    Calculator defaults are illustrative estimates. Always confirm the exact model, total price,
    delivery terms, and return policy at the destination website before buying.
  </p>
  <p>
    Third-party sites operate under their own privacy practices and terms. An affiliate link may
    allow a retailer to attribute a qualifying purchase to a referral.
  </p>
  <h2>Further information</h2>
  <p>
    The disclosure approach follows the principles described in the{' '}
    <a
      href="https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/ftcs-endorsement-guides-what-people-are-asking"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      FTC's endorsement guidance
    </a>
    . Amazon participation, if activated, is subject to the{' '}
    <a
      href="https://affiliate-program.amazon.com/help/operating/agreement"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Amazon Associates Operating Agreement
    </a>
    .
  </p>
  <p>
    For questions about a commercial link or this disclosure, email{' '}
    <a href="mailto:hello.jclabs@gmail.com">hello.jclabs@gmail.com</a>.
  </p>
</Editorial>
